#: ../../library/os.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`os` --- basic \"operating system\" services"
msgstr ":mod:`os` --- osnovne usluge \"operacijskog sustava\""

#: ../../library/os.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``os`` module contains functions for filesystem access and mounting, "
"terminal redirection and duplication, and the ``uname`` and ``urandom`` "
"functions."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``os`` sadrži funkcije za pristup datotečnom sustavu i montiranje, "
"preusmjeravanje i dupliranje terminala te funkcije ``uname`` i ``urandom``\\"
" ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:12
msgid "General functions"
msgstr "Općenite funkcije"

#: ../../library/os.rst:16
msgid ""
"Return a tuple (possibly a named tuple) containing information about the "
"underlying machine and/or its operating system.  The tuple has five fields "
"in the following order, each of them being a string:"
msgstr ""
"Vraća torku (moguće imenovanu torku) koja sadrži informacije o osnovnom "
"stroju i/ili njegovom operacijskom sustavu. Torka ima pet polja sljedećim "
"redoslijedom, od kojih je svako niz znakova:"

#: ../../library/os.rst:20
msgid "``sysname`` -- The name of the underlying system"
msgstr "``sysname`` -- Naziv osnovnog sustava"

#: ../../library/os.rst:21
msgid "``nodename`` -- The network name (can be the same as ``sysname``)"
msgstr "``nodename`` -- Mrežni naziv (može biti isti kao ``sysname``\\ )"

#: ../../library/os.rst:22
msgid "``release`` -- The version of the underlying system"
msgstr "``release`` -- Verzija osnovnog sustava"

#: ../../library/os.rst:23
msgid "``version`` -- The MicroPython version and build date"
msgstr "``version`` -- Verzija MicroPythona i datum izgradnje"

#: ../../library/os.rst:24
msgid ""
"``machine`` -- An identifier for the underlying hardware (e.g. board, CPU)"
msgstr "``machine`` -- Identifikator osnovnog hardvera (npr. ploča, CPU)"

#: ../../library/os.rst:28
msgid ""
"Return a bytes object with *n* random bytes. The source is cryptographically"
" suitable on every supported cam, though the implementation varies by port:"
msgstr ""
"Vraća bytes objekt s *n* nasumičnih bajtova. Izvor je kriptografski "
"prikladan na svakoj podržanoj kameri, iako se implementacija razlikuje "
"ovisno o portu:"

#: ../../library/os.rst:32
msgid ""
"**STM32 cams** (M4, M7, H7, H7+, PT, N6) use the STM32 hardware RNG "
"peripheral."
msgstr ""
"**STM32 kamere** (M4, M7, H7, H7+, PT, N6) koriste hardversku RNG periferiju"
" STM32."

#: ../../library/os.rst:34
msgid "**i.MX RT1062 cams** (RT1060) use the chip's hardware TRNG."
msgstr "**i.MX RT1062 kamere** (RT1060) koriste hardverski TRNG čipa."

#: ../../library/os.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Alif Ensemble cams** (AE3) use the Secure Enclave's hardware random "
"service."
msgstr ""
"**Alif Ensemble kamere** (AE3) koriste hardversku uslugu nasumičnosti Secure"
" Enclavea."

#: ../../library/os.rst:37
msgid "**Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense** uses the nRF52 hardware RNG peripheral."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense** koristi hardversku RNG periferiju nRF52."

#: ../../library/os.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect** has no hardware TRNG; the pico-sdk PRNG is "
"seeded and continuously re-mixed with the RP2040's on-chip entropy sources."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect** nema hardverski TRNG; PRNG iz pico-sdk-a "
"inicijaliziran je sjemenom i kontinuirano se ponovno miješa s izvorima "
"entropije na čipu RP2040."

#: ../../library/os.rst:44
msgid "Filesystem access"
msgstr "Pristup datotečnom sustavu"

#: ../../library/os.rst:48
msgid "Change current directory."
msgstr "Mijenja trenutni direktorij."

#: ../../library/os.rst:52
msgid "Get the current directory."
msgstr "Dohvaća trenutni direktorij."

#: ../../library/os.rst:56
msgid ""
"This function returns an iterator which then yields tuples corresponding to "
"the entries in the directory that it is listing.  With no argument it lists "
"the current directory, otherwise it lists the directory given by *dir*."
msgstr ""
"Ova funkcija vraća iterator koji zatim daje torke koje odgovaraju unosima u "
"direktoriju koji se ispisuje. Bez argumenta ispisuje trenutni direktorij, "
"inače ispisuje direktorij zadan s *dir*\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:60
msgid "The tuples have the form *(name, type, inode[, size])*:"
msgstr "Torke imaju oblik *(name, type, inode[, size])*\\ :"

#: ../../library/os.rst:62
msgid ""
"*name* is a string (or bytes if *dir* is a bytes object) and is the name of "
"the entry;"
msgstr ""
"*name* je niz znakova (ili bajtovi ako je *dir* bytes objekt) i predstavlja "
"naziv unosa;"

#: ../../library/os.rst:64
msgid ""
"*type* is an integer that specifies the type of the entry, with 0x4000 for "
"directories and 0x8000 for regular files;"
msgstr ""
"*type* je cijeli broj koji određuje vrstu unosa, gdje je 0x4000 za "
"direktorije i 0x8000 za obične datoteke;"

#: ../../library/os.rst:66
msgid ""
"*inode* is an integer corresponding to the inode of the file, and may be 0 "
"for filesystems that don't have such a notion."
msgstr ""
"*inode* je cijeli broj koji odgovara inodeu datoteke, a može biti 0 za "
"datotečne sustave koji nemaju takav pojam."

#: ../../library/os.rst:68
msgid ""
"*size* is an integer that may be included depending on the filesystem type. "
"For file entries, *size* represents the size of the file or -1 if unknown. "
"Its meaning is currently undefined for directory entries."
msgstr ""
"*size* je cijeli broj koji može biti uključen ovisno o vrsti datotečnog "
"sustava. Za datotečne unose *size* predstavlja veličinu datoteke ili -1 ako "
"je nepoznata. Njegovo značenje trenutno nije definirano za unose "
"direktorija."

#: ../../library/os.rst:74
msgid ""
"With no argument, list the current directory.  Otherwise list the given "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"Bez argumenta ispisuje trenutni direktorij. Inače ispisuje zadani "
"direktorij."

#: ../../library/os.rst:78
msgid "Create a new directory."
msgstr "Stvara novi direktorij."

#: ../../library/os.rst:82
msgid "Remove a file."
msgstr "Uklanja datoteku."

#: ../../library/os.rst:86
msgid "Remove a file. This is an alias for :func:`remove`."
msgstr "Uklanja datoteku. Ovo je alias za :func:`remove`\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:90
msgid "Remove a directory."
msgstr "Uklanja direktorij."

#: ../../library/os.rst:94
msgid "Rename a file."
msgstr "Preimenuje datoteku."

#: ../../library/os.rst:98
msgid "Get the status of a file or directory."
msgstr "Dohvaća status datoteke ili direktorija."

#: ../../library/os.rst:102
msgid "Get the status of a filesystem."
msgstr "Dohvaća status datotečnog sustava."

#: ../../library/os.rst:104
msgid ""
"Returns a tuple with the filesystem information in the following order:"
msgstr ""
"Vraća torku s informacijama o datotečnom sustavu sljedećim redoslijedom:"

#: ../../library/os.rst:106
msgid "``f_bsize`` -- File system block size"
msgstr "``f_bsize`` -- Veličina bloka datotečnog sustava"

#: ../../library/os.rst:107
msgid "``f_frsize`` -- Fragment size"
msgstr "``f_frsize`` -- Veličina fragmenta"

#: ../../library/os.rst:108
msgid "``f_blocks`` -- Size of fs in f_frsize units"
msgstr "``f_blocks`` -- Veličina datotečnog sustava u jedinicama f_frsize"

#: ../../library/os.rst:109
msgid "``f_bfree`` -- Number of free blocks"
msgstr "``f_bfree`` -- Broj slobodnih blokova"

#: ../../library/os.rst:110
msgid "``f_bavail`` -- Number of free blocks for unprivileged users"
msgstr "``f_bavail`` -- Broj slobodnih blokova za neprivilegirane korisnike"

#: ../../library/os.rst:111
msgid "``f_files`` -- Number of inodes"
msgstr "``f_files`` -- Broj inodea"

#: ../../library/os.rst:112
msgid "``f_ffree`` -- Number of free inodes"
msgstr "``f_ffree`` -- Broj slobodnih inodea"

#: ../../library/os.rst:113
msgid "``f_favail`` -- Number of free inodes for unprivileged users"
msgstr "``f_favail`` -- Broj slobodnih inodea za neprivilegirane korisnike"

#: ../../library/os.rst:114
msgid "``f_flag`` -- Mount flags"
msgstr "``f_flag`` -- Zastavice montiranja"

#: ../../library/os.rst:115
msgid "``f_namemax`` -- Maximum filename length"
msgstr "``f_namemax`` -- Maksimalna duljina naziva datoteke"

#: ../../library/os.rst:117
msgid ""
"Parameters related to inodes: ``f_files``, ``f_ffree``, ``f_favail`` and the"
" ``f_flag`` parameter may return ``0`` as they can be unavailable in a port-"
"specific implementation."
msgstr ""
"Parametri povezani s inodeima: ``f_files``\\ , ``f_ffree``\\ , ``f_favail`` "
"i parametar ``f_flag`` mogu vratiti ``0`` jer mogu biti nedostupni u "
"implementaciji specifičnoj za port."

#: ../../library/os.rst:123
msgid "Sync all filesystems."
msgstr "Sinkronizira sve datotečne sustave."

#: ../../library/os.rst:128
msgid ""
"The path-component separator used by the filesystem, the string ``'/'``."
msgstr ""
"Razdjelnik komponenti putanje koji koristi datotečni sustav, niz ``'/'``\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:131
msgid "Terminal redirection and duplication"
msgstr "Preusmjeravanje i dupliranje terminala"

#: ../../library/os.rst:135
msgid ""
"Duplicate or switch the MicroPython terminal (the REPL) on the given "
":std:term:`stream`-like object. The *stream_object* argument must be a "
"native stream object, or derive from :class:`io.IOBase` and implement the "
"``readinto()`` and ``write()`` methods.  The stream should be in non-"
"blocking mode and ``readinto()`` should return ``None`` if there is no data "
"available for reading."
msgstr ""
"Duplicira ili prebacuje MicroPython terminal (REPL) na zadani objekt nalik "
":std:term:`stream`\\ . Argument *stream_object* mora biti izvorni stream "
"objekt, ili izvedenica iz :class:`io.IOBase` koja implementira metode "
"``readinto()`` i ``write()``\\ . Stream bi trebao biti u neblokirajućem "
"načinu rada, a ``readinto()`` bi trebao vratiti ``None`` ako nema dostupnih "
"podataka za čitanje."

#: ../../library/os.rst:141
msgid ""
"After calling this function all terminal output is repeated on this stream, "
"and any input that is available on the stream is passed on to the terminal "
"input."
msgstr ""
"Nakon pozivanja ove funkcije sav izlaz terminala ponavlja se na tom streamu,"
" a svaki ulaz dostupan na streamu prosljeđuje se ulazu terminala."

#: ../../library/os.rst:144
msgid ""
"The *index* parameter should be a non-negative integer and specifies which "
"duplication slot is set.  A given port may implement more than one slot "
"(slot 0 will always be available) and in that case terminal input and output"
" is duplicated on all the slots that are set."
msgstr ""
"Parametar *index* trebao bi biti nenegativni cijeli broj i određuje koji se "
"utor za dupliranje postavlja. Određeni port može implementirati više od "
"jednog utora (utor 0 uvijek će biti dostupan), pa se u tom slučaju ulaz i "
"izlaz terminala dupliciraju na svim postavljenim utorima."

#: ../../library/os.rst:149
msgid ""
"If ``None`` is passed as the *stream_object* then duplication is cancelled "
"on the slot given by *index*."
msgstr ""
"Ako se kao *stream_object* proslijedi ``None``\\ , dupliranje na utoru "
"zadanom s *index* se otkazuje."

#: ../../library/os.rst:152
msgid ""
"The function returns the previous stream-like object in the given slot."
msgstr "Funkcija vraća prethodni objekt nalik streamu u zadanom utoru."

#: ../../library/os.rst:156
msgid ""
"Notify the MicroPython REPL that input is available on a stream-like object "
"previously registered via :func:`os.dupterm`."
msgstr ""
"Obavještava MicroPython REPL da je ulaz dostupan na objektu nalik streamu "
"prethodno registriranom putem :func:`os.dupterm`\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:159
msgid ""
"This function should be called by custom stream implementations (e.g., UART,"
" Bluetooth, or other non-USB REPL streams) to inform the REPL that input is "
"ready to be read. Proper use ensures that special characters such as Ctrl+C "
"(used to trigger KeyboardInterrupt) are processed promptly by the REPL, "
"enabling expected interruption behavior for user code."
msgstr ""
"Ovu funkciju trebaju pozivati prilagođene implementacije streamova (npr. "
"UART, Bluetooth ili drugi REPL streamovi koji nisu USB) kako bi obavijestile"
" REPL da je ulaz spreman za čitanje. Pravilna upotreba osigurava da REPL "
"pravovremeno obrađuje posebne znakove poput Ctrl+C (koji se koristi za "
"pokretanje KeyboardInterrupt), omogućujući očekivano ponašanje prekida za "
"korisnički kod."

#: ../../library/os.rst:165
msgid ""
"The *obj_in* parameter is ignored by :func:`os.dupterm_notify`, but is "
"required to allow calling dupterm_notify from an interrupt handler such as "
"`UART.irq()`."
msgstr ""
"Parametar *obj_in* zanemaruje :func:`os.dupterm_notify`\\ , ali je potreban "
"kako bi se omogućilo pozivanje dupterm_notify iz rukovatelja prekida poput "
"`UART.irq()`\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:168
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "Primjer:"

#: ../../library/os.rst:179
msgid ""
"If the ``dupterm_notify()`` function is not called, input from the custom "
"stream may not be detected or processed until the next REPL poll, "
"potentially delaying KeyboardInterrupts or other control signals. This is "
"especially important for UART, Bluetooth and other non-standard REPL "
"connections, where automatic notification is not guaranteed."
msgstr ""
"Ako se funkcija ``dupterm_notify()`` ne pozove, ulaz iz prilagođenog streama"
" možda neće biti otkriven ili obrađen do sljedećeg REPL ispitivanja, čime se"
" potencijalno odgađa KeyboardInterrupt ili drugi kontrolni signali. Ovo je "
"posebno važno za UART, Bluetooth i druge nestandardne REPL veze, gdje "
"automatska obavijest nije zajamčena."

#: ../../library/os.rst:186
msgid "Filesystem mounting"
msgstr "Montiranje datotečnog sustava"

#: ../../library/os.rst:188
msgid ""
"The following functions and classes have been moved to the :mod:`vfs` "
"module. They are provided in this module only for backwards compatibility "
"and will be removed in version 2 of MicroPython."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeće funkcije i klase premještene su u modul :mod:`vfs`\\ . U ovom su "
"modulu navedene samo radi povratne kompatibilnosti i bit će uklonjene u "
"verziji 2 MicroPythona."

#: ../../library/os.rst:194
msgid ""
"Mount the filesystem object *fsobj* at the location in the VFS given by the "
"*mount_point* string.  *fsobj* can be a VFS object that has a ``mount()`` "
"method, or a block device.  If it's a block device then the filesystem type "
"is automatically detected (an exception is raised if no filesystem was "
"recognised).  *mount_point* may be ``'/'`` to mount *fsobj* at the root, or "
"``'/<name>'`` to mount it at a subdirectory under the root."
msgstr ""
"Montira objekt datotečnog sustava *fsobj* na lokaciju u VFS-u zadanu nizom "
"*mount_point*\\ . *fsobj* može biti VFS objekt koji ima metodu ``mount()``\\"
" , ili blok uređaj. Ako je riječ o blok uređaju, vrsta datotečnog sustava "
"automatski se otkriva (podiže se iznimka ako nijedan datotečni sustav nije "
"prepoznat). *mount_point* može biti ``'/'`` za montiranje *fsobj* u korijen,"
" ili ``'/<name>'`` za montiranje u poddirektorij ispod korijena."

#: ../../library/os.rst:201
msgid "If *readonly* is ``True`` then the filesystem is mounted read-only."
msgstr ""
"Ako je *readonly* postavljen na ``True``\\ , datotečni sustav montira se "
"samo za čitanje."

#: ../../library/os.rst:203
msgid ""
"During the mount process the method ``mount()`` is called on the filesystem "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Tijekom procesa montiranja na objektu datotečnog sustava poziva se metoda "
"``mount()``\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:206
msgid "Will raise ``OSError(EPERM)`` if *mount_point* is already mounted."
msgstr "Podiže ``OSError(EPERM)`` ako je *mount_point* već montiran."

#: ../../library/os.rst:211
msgid ""
"With no arguments to :func:`mount`, return a list of tuples representing all"
" active mountpoints."
msgstr ""
"Bez argumenata za :func:`mount` vraća popis torki koje predstavljaju sve "
"aktivne točke montiranja."

#: ../../library/os.rst:214
msgid "The returned list has the form *[(fsobj, mount_point), ...]*."
msgstr "Vraćeni popis ima oblik *[(fsobj, mount_point), ...]*\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:218
msgid ""
"Unmount a filesystem. *mount_point* can be a string naming the mount "
"location, or a previously-mounted filesystem object.  During the unmount "
"process the method ``umount()`` is called on the filesystem object."
msgstr ""
"Demontira datotečni sustav. *mount_point* može biti niz koji imenuje "
"lokaciju montiranja, ili prethodno montirani objekt datotečnog sustava. "
"Tijekom procesa demontiranja na objektu datotečnog sustava poziva se metoda "
"``umount()``\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:222
msgid "Will raise ``OSError(EINVAL)`` if *mount_point* is not found."
msgstr "Podiže ``OSError(EINVAL)`` ako *mount_point* nije pronađen."

#: ../../library/os.rst:226
msgid ""
"Create a filesystem object that uses the FAT filesystem format.  Storage of "
"the FAT filesystem is provided by *block_dev*. Objects created by this "
"constructor can be mounted using :func:`mount`."
msgstr ""
"Stvara objekt datotečnog sustava koji koristi format datotečnog sustava FAT."
" Pohranu FAT datotečnog sustava pruža *block_dev*\\ . Objekti stvoreni ovim "
"konstruktorom mogu se montirati pomoću :func:`mount`\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:232
msgid "Build a FAT filesystem on *block_dev*."
msgstr "Izgrađuje FAT datotečni sustav na *block_dev*\\ ."

#: ../../library/os.rst:236
msgid ""
"Create a filesystem object that accesses the host POSIX filesystem. If "
"*root* is specified then it should be a path in the host filesystem to use "
"as the root of the ``VfsPosix`` object.  Otherwise the current directory of "
"the host filesystem is used."
msgstr ""
"Stvara objekt datotečnog sustava koji pristupa POSIX datotečnom sustavu "
"domaćina. Ako je naveden *root*\\ , on bi trebao biti putanja u datotečnom "
"sustavu domaćina koja se koristi kao korijen objekta ``VfsPosix``\\ . Inače "
"se koristi trenutni direktorij datotečnog sustava domaćina."

#: ../../library/os.rst:241
msgid ""
"``VfsPosix`` is only available on the Unix port; it is not present on the "
"OpenMV Cam."
msgstr ""
"``VfsPosix`` dostupan je samo na Unix portu; nije prisutan na OpenMV Cam."
